    "status": "present",
    "value": "A car starts at position 0 with speed +1 on an infinite number line. Instruction A moves the car by its speed and then doubles the speed. Instruction R reverses direction: the speed becomes -1 if it was positive, or +1 if it was negative, and the position stays the same. Return the length of the shortest instruction sequence that brings the car to a given positive target position."
  },
